-- RLS contract: every policy derives organization_id from authenticated active membership and checks the exact permission.
-- Never accept organization_id from the browser. Revoke direct financial mutations from authenticated before integration.
-- Required SECURITY DEFINER RPC contracts (not implemented or integration-tested here):
-- procurement_next_number(document_type, document_year) -> atomic organization-scoped number.
-- procurement_reserve_budget(requisition_id, expected_budget_version, idempotency_key) -> lock and reserve.
-- procurement_release_budget(requisition_id, reason, idempotency_key) -> counter-operation only.
-- procurement_approve_receipt(receipt_id, expected_version, idempotency_key) -> prevent over-receipt atomically.
-- procurement_match_supplier_bill(bill_id, expected versions, tolerance snapshot) -> 2-way/3-way match.
-- procurement_recognize_cost(source_type, source_id, expected_version, idempotency_key) -> one recognized event.
-- procurement_reverse_cost(source_type, source_id, reason, idempotency_key) -> immutable counter-event.
